                        "entry_id": "9e23de07-b3f7-3ec3-93c1-804b6a59521c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small thickened portion or knot found in yarn, caused by defects or intentionally leaving sections of the yarn unspun."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d652e98c-6b18-41a1-9791-7f083da6ea03",
                                "sense_id": "9303b21c-c2b3-3d57-993e-66f7b9f35067",
                                "text": "The challenge is not just to produce a thick-and-thin yarn, but to make soft slubs, connected by nicely spun yarn without overtwist. The should not be lumps and bumps that happen by accident, but a contrived texture, with the size and placement of the slubs completely controlled by the spinner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e2141a5-0543-466f-90d8-6ce4cb37f2dd",
                                "sense_id": "9303b21c-c2b3-3d57-993e-66f7b9f35067",
                                "text": "The huge bolts of cloth had to be checked for imperfections such as slubs and misweaves."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4fd2cba0-aa57-3d99-99c0-280d52f71cdb",
